uxmaster-sshguard (2.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Merge upstream 2.6.0, updating the version and release documentation.
  * Extend Coturn signatures to plain TCP failures and malformed STUN
    request logs containing the remote address.
  * Require explicit transport in scored Coturn records to prevent bans
    based on spoofed UDP sources. Accept DTLS request errors after record
    authentication; keep socket shutdown/closure signatures limited to TCP/TLS.
  * Score malformed Coturn requests at 10 points and transport events at
    1 point, including repeated records from the same session. Keep normal
    authentication challenges and nonce refreshes unscored.
  * Use an exclusive Coturn scanner state and skip unused log fields.

 -- Jacek <sshguard@drStypula.pl>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:45:39 +0200

