uxmaster-sshguard (2.5.1+20260923-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Connect the iptables backend to IPv4 and IPv6 INPUT on startup, without
    duplicate jumps, and detach it on shutdown. Previously, service startup
    could leave an unreferenced chain and recorded bans had no effect.
  * Test actual packet blocking and backend lifecycle in private namespaces.

