uxmaster-sshguard (2.5.1+20260923-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support Coturn 4.17 and 4.18 logs while retaining support for older
    Coturn log formats.
  * Treat all HTTP 401 responses in Common Log Format as attacks.
  * Reduce false positives in web logs, including HTTP redirects and
    unrelated URLs containing "mail".
  * Recognize updated OpenSSH, Dovecot, Exim and Postfix authentication logs.
  * Add attack detection for Dropbear SSH, MySQL, the pfSense Web
    Configurator and Proxmox VE.
  * Improve syslog detection for fully qualified hostnames, IP addresses
    and RFC 5424 messages from sysklogd.
  * Recognize longer web requests and improve handling of quoted log fields.
  * Fix memory growth when processing IPv6 logs.
  * Fix service shutdown hangs and unreliable termination during restarts.
  * Allow configuring block duration increases for repeat offenders and
    optionally accumulating attack scores per IPv4/IPv6 subnet.
  * Add optional Prometheus-compatible attack statistics.
  * Allow running the log parser and blocker as an unprivileged user.

 -- Jacek <sshguard@drStypula.pl>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:13:57 +0200

